---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: help_of(line)
---
Show a template's content.
It prints the name, description and the objects the template holds.

USAGE
  holst template show <template>

ARGUMENTS
  template   The template: id or name

INHERITED FLAGS
  --output, --verbose, --base-url, --home, --no-cache, --help   as in `holst -h`

EXAMPLES
  $ holst tpl show "Retro"
  $ holst tpl show "Retro" -o json

LEARN MORE
  A template is given as its id or its name.
  Exit codes: `holst help exit-codes`.
